ngine/godot/pull/119592.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This fixes an issue with type resolution that triggers when the scripts at play are shallow, meaning the compilation pass has not been run and `GDScript#base` has not been populated yet. The existing logic relies on `GDScript#base` for validation, which (obviously) fails for shallow scripts. \r\n\r\nThis PR completely tosses `can_reference` and redirects the check to `is_type_compatible`, which implements the \"correct\" logic.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101925\r\n_Maintainer edit: Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100392_","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119592/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119592/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}